"project/aibrix/blob/main/samples/quickstart/tensorrt/tensor-rt.yaml>`_ — "
"standard single-instance deployment"
msgstr ""
"`samples/quickstart/tensorrt/tensor-rt.yaml <https://github.com/vllm-"
